menuconfig MODULES_COMP_ATTITUDE
	bool "Composite dual-aircraft attitude estimator"
	default n
	depends on MODULES_AIRLINK
	depends on MODULES_EKF2
	---help---
		Run an independent EKF2 core using the 0.5/0.5 master and slave IMUs.
		Both aircraft map to independent composite FRD before fusion
		(default A->C=-30 deg, B->C=+30 deg, q_AB=+60 deg). Publishes
		estimate, health and yaw topics.
